          "settings": {
            "question": "Is Frood vegan?",
            "answer": "<p>Absolutely! Frood’s savoury range is formulated with dehydrated plant based ingredients and herbs and is suitable for vegans. Each pack details a variety of handy tips including different proteins that can be added to your dish.</p>"
