          "settings": {
            "question": "What are the allergens in Frood products?",
            "answer": "<p>Please see a list of our existing products allergens.This list will be updated as regularly as possible, however for absolute certainty on product allergens please always refer to the back of the pouch information. <strong><br/><br/><br/><br/>Swedish Meatball Blend<br/></strong>Wheat & Barley: Risk of cross-contamination.<br/>Contains Wholegrain Oatmeal<br/>Gluten:  Risk of cross-contamination.<br/>Contains Mustard Powder<br/>Contains Brown Linseed<br/>Contains Garlic Powder</p><p><strong>Golden Curry Blend<br/></strong>There is a risk of gluten<br/>There is a risk of soya <br/>Contains Yeast Extract<br/>Mustard: Potential cross contamination within the supply chain.<br/>Contains Faba Bean Protein<br/>Contains Celery Root Powder<br/>Contains Garlic Powder</p><p><strong>Bella Bollognese Blend<br/></strong>Contains Yeast Extract (Flavouring Preparation)<br/>Contains Dehydrated Celery Root Powder<br/>Contains Garlic Powder</p><p><strong>Mexi Fiesta Blend </strong>Gluten: Risk of wheat gluten contamination<br/>Onion<br/>Contains Yeast Extract<br/>Contains Dehydrated Celery Root<br/>Contains Garlic Powder</p>"
