            "answer": "<p>Once your order has been shipped, you will receive a shipping confirmation email with tracking details. Frood deliveries are mailbox friendly and therefore do not require signatures upon delivery. Please ensure you follow your order journey via the Royal Mail tracking link, and update the carrier of any special delivery requests directly. </p>"
