        "question_KGcqcG": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you offer refunds?",
            "answer": "<p>As your purchase is a perishable food item, it is exempt from the 14-day statutory cooling-off period under the Consumer Contracts Regulations 2013. This means we’re unable to offer a refund unless the product is faulty, not as described, or unfit for consumption.</p><p>If you believe the item is faulty or there is an issue with its quality, please let us know and provide details (and photos if possible), and we’ll be happy to review this for you.</p><p>Thank you for your understanding.</p>"
          }
